  "body": "## What changed\n\nUpdate seven existing guide pages for the twelve features and settings listed in #3403.\nName each control, explain its behavior, give an example and describe refusals and remedies.\nCorrect the obsolete Router kind, Deburr width and blanket warning descriptions.\nRecord the choices in `docs/decisions/3403-guide-v026.md`.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe features merged after v0.25.0 without matching guide updates.\nThe next cut builds its site from the tagged guide sources.\nThis branch starts at upstream/main `68d645261`.\n\n## Tests\n\nAll twelve pins in `site/tests/test_release_026_guide.py::Release026Guide` failed on the unchanged guide and pass with these edits:\n\n- `test_v_carve_explains_medial_axis_and_width_depth_example`\n- `test_pocket_rest_machining_uses_previous_operations`\n- `test_deburr_documents_chord_depth_passes_and_breaking_change`\n- `test_dxf_placement_has_stock_page_drop_and_unit_refusal`\n- `test_cutting_data_names_nonmetal_materials_and_control`\n- `test_router_kind_exposes_milling_options`\n- `test_fanuc_ai_contour_has_enable_accuracy_and_cancel`\n- `test_fanuc_manual_guide_blank_has_words_and_limits`\n- `test_boundary_offsets_are_named_separately`\n- `test_wire_sharp_inside_corner_option_is_off_by_default`\n- `test_3d_adaptive_fallback_is_a_visible_warning`\n- `test_circular_returns_to_clearance_between_rings`\n\nEach page mutation restored its exact upstream text, made the pins fail and passed after restoring the updated page:\n\n- `operations-2d.md`: red, then green.\n- `operations-3d.md`: red, then green.\n- `operations-edm.md`: red, then green.\n- `setups.md`: red, then green.\n- `tools.md`: red, then green.\n- `machines.md`: red, then green.\n- `posting.md`: red, then green.\n\n`zola build` in `site/` passes with 49 pages and 10 sections.\n`python3 -B -m unittest discover -s site/tests -v` passes all 94 tests.\nThe first site run lacked Node.\nThe rerun used an official Node binary in `/tmp`, checked against its published SHA256 checksum.\n\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` stalled in sccache.\nA retry without the wrapper waited on the build lock left by that compile.\nThe sandbox hid the lock owner, so no unknown process was killed.\nThe final quick gate used the existing `issue-3344/target/debug/xtask` binary.\nIts xtask sources match this branch byte for byte, its binary is newer than those sources, and its source tree is clean.\nRuntime `CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR` selected this issue's workspace.\nThe run disabled cache seeding with `CAMCRAFT_NO_SEED=1` and used an empty compiler wrapper.\nIt reports base `68d6452`, nine changed files, zero selected Rust steps and zero failures.\nThe unit-directory sweep skipped the held Cargo lock.\nClippy does not apply because no Rust crate changed.\n`git diff --check` passes.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone.\n`git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNo manual GUI session, new screenshots, machine run or release lanes ran.\nThe Cargo launcher did not finish because of the compile-cache stall and build lock.\nThe matching-tool quick gate selected no Rust tests for this documentation diff.\nNo product code, post or golden changed.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nEach PR below touches the same file, different guide paragraphs or controls; whichever merges second refreshes.\n\n- #3353: 2D Offset pass starts.\n- #3387: Face and 2D Offset pass starts.\n- #3391: Pocket pass starts; this PR adds rest-stock instructions in another paragraph.\n- #3402: Adaptive and Offset pass starts.\n- #3396: Offset pass starts inherited from its parent.\n- #3401: Face, Slot and inherited Offset pass starts.\n- #3228: Sodick conditions in the EDM and machine pages.\n- #3312: G-EDM post entries in the machine and posting pages.\n\nEffort: medium\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #3403\n",
